{
  "$comment": [
    "Example MCP client configuration for the deployed oura-mcp server.",
    "Replace oura-mcp.example.com with your ingress hostname and paste your",
    "MCP_API_KEY into the Authorization header. Do not commit a filled-in copy.",
    "",
    "The API key is not issued by Oura or anyone else -- you generate it:",
    "  python -c \"import secrets; print(secrets.token_urlsafe(48))\"",
    "The same value must be the MCP_API_KEY key of the server's Kubernetes",
    "Secret and the bearer token below.",
    "",
    "Claude Code, from the repo root:",
    "  claude mcp add --transport http oura https://oura-mcp.example.com/mcp \\",
    "    --header \"Authorization: Bearer $MCP_API_KEY\"",
    "",
    "Claude Desktop / Claude web: add it as a Custom Connector using the same",
    "URL and header. ChatGPT is NOT supported yet: its connector dialog only",
    "offers OAuth or no auth, and this server uses a static bearer token.",
    "Any Streamable HTTP MCP client works; the transport and auth are standard."
  ],
  "mcpServers": {
    "oura": {
      "type": "http",
      "url": "https://oura-mcp.example.com/mcp",
      "headers": {
        "Authorization": "Bearer REPLACE_WITH_YOUR_MCP_API_KEY"
      }
    }
  }
}